              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "活 — huó — \"to live; alive\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "他活了一百岁 tā huó le yìbǎi suì — He lived to a hundred."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The new character, in pieces: 活 (huó) — nine strokes in three pieces: the water piece of 洗 on the left, three strokes; then 千, three strokes; then 口 under it. The next lesson puts it in your hand."
            }
